					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320904,
					"content": "这不是和烟花一模一样嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320905,
					"content": "——意犹未尽，意犹未尽啊，这真是我做过的最真实，最豪华，最浪漫的一场梦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320906,
					"content": "我也是，不过我真没想到，你会直接带着我们跳上去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320907,
					"content": "嘿嘿，其实我也没想太多，只是觉得不趁机胡闹一次，那就太可惜了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320908,
						130320909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320908,
					"content": "宵宫，你其实…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320909,
					"content": "早就意识到是梦了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320910,
					"content": "你知道我的，是不是梦之类的问题，我完全不在乎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320911,
					"content": "但我还是要感谢你们，这一切都是你们知道了流星雨没那么容易看到，所以才准备的替代方案吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320912,
					"content": "我很喜欢哦，非常非常喜欢，就算在我收到过的所有礼物里排名，都是最好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320913,
					"content": "那就好，那就好，我还担心和你解释了真相，你会生气呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320914,
					"content": "怎么会呢？我梦见了乐于助人，性格友善，可可爱爱的兰那罗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320915,
					"content": "还梦见了我们在一堆大蘑菇里到处跑到处飞，用意料之外的方式找到了「苍松石」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320916,
					"content": "原本以为醒过来了，接下来的事情却更加了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320917,
					"content": "艾文从心口取出了「苍松石」变成的眼镜，我们一起找到了从地上飞起来的流星，成为了流星的一部分…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320918,
						130320919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320918,
					"content": "我们一直都在梦中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320920
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320919,
					"content": "我们从未醒来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320920
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320920,
					"content": "是啊，虽然梦是虚幻的，但同样是不可复制，不可重温的一次「经历」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320921,
					"content": "如果拘泥于真假，那岂不是就错过了很多美好与感动嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320922,
					"content": "嘿嘿，宵宫真会夸。我要把你在「派蒙的好朋友」排行榜上再提高一位！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320923,
					"content": "还有这种排行榜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320924
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320924,
					"content": "对了，说到兰那罗，他们不愿意被…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320925
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320925,
					"content": "对啊对啊，兰那罗也好可爱，这还要多亏了那些制作精美的木刻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320926,
					"content": "欸，木刻？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320927
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320927,
					"content": "对啊，如果我们没见过木刻，怎么会梦见那种样子的兰那罗嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320928,
					"content": "……？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320929,
						130320930
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320929,
					"content": "宵宫明白我们的意思了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320931
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320930,
					"content": "我也觉得比木刻更可爱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320931
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130320931,
					"content": "嘻嘻，放心啦，我懂的。我觉得他们的形象很可爱，我很乐意保护他们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130320932
					],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130320932,
					"content": "好了，时间也差不多了，该送她回家了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "宵宫"
				},
				{
					"id": 130321101,
					"content": "将艾文送回了家，又和宵宫在须弥逗留了几天。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130321102
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1303211,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1303211
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
